[Info]
Name	The Lost Legion
Description	Three portals of heroes, two approaches, one temple. No rival keeper, so the only question is how long you last. Skirmish. A hero company holds a walled keep in the wilds; storm them for their gold, or leave them be and fight whatever they send out.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
[/Info]

